{
  "count": "The outlined yellow dot's last yellow must also touch the outlined purple dot, so this cell must be purple.",
  "countFull": "The outlined yellow dot's last yellow must also touch the outlined purple dot, so this cell must be purple.",
  "countShort": "The outlined purple dot allows at most one yellow beside the outlined yellow tile, so this cell must be yellow.",
